  dialogue:
  - Hey there, everyone! I've come to see you all!
  - 'Oh? This is not the concert venue. '
  - Ohh, those donuts look EGG-cellent! Especially that one! It looks like my hair
    in the morning. I'll take it!
  responses:
  - responseText: Won't you get fat?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b483007b0df201142a829ea3db5eb43e, type: 2}
  - responseText: Where can I buy your shirt?
